Teaches you: Hailstorm. 
Hailstorm: Ice shards pelt the target area doing 173.62 Frost damage over 6 sec.

@ext:Scales with Blizzard modifiers.:ext@

Dealing damage with Frostbolt and Frostfire Bolt generates an Icicle. You can store up to 5 Icicles. At 5 stacks, your Ice Lance will treat the target as frozen.

Dealing damage with Ice Lance rapidly launches your stored Icicles at the target, dealing ${239*$<scalingbp>+0*0.36} Frost damage. Each Icicle also increases the damage the target takes from your Deep Freeze by 2%, stacking up to 100.

@ext:You cannot gain Icicles while they are launching.:ext@

Teaches you: Rune of Power. 
Rune of Power: Places a Rune of Power on the ground which increases all magic damage you deal by 20% and reduces the mana cost of Arcane Blast by 100% while you stand within 5 yards. Lasts for 15 sec.

@ext:This does not stack with Arcane Power.:ext@

